  "body": "## Changelog\n* 2ff2c5c18b90046fa4de561b536d4804f66faaaa Add support for custom theme\n* 05898e0bf8f30edefbaf2c9c18e627212c6f4f08 Added a Nix flake for package building and devshell use.\n* 8c5cb23df716f275c4d081982f049e73527f19ea Create nix.yaml\n* 519702fd963153d23140c34c3cdc5fdd2bbd819c Implement configuration persistence\n* 0ae381ce162c8184f172e253667a6cb9bee35420 Merge pull request #5 from deephack1982/master\n* 1bd81d955b300de2c09f81691268a5f878026dfc Update PKGBUILD\n* 0977396e091604a0a15a8f355d24fc06ca3d70bf Update flake.nix\n* 33d1e57d609b2d8ef02277ee828013cd32080100 Update go.mod\n* 8a7205eec74828f85697e415a08e79f011993b46 Use Git config when locating mailmap; closes #2\n\n"
